Synthetic scorer self-test case: precedent-relocated-not-new

Task: T1 (score.ts --task T1)
Rules: S5, S7

Scenario
The pre-existing findOrder import moves out of src/payments/service.ts into a new src/payments/order-lookup.ts, whose loadPayableOrder() wraps it. processPayment() now calls loadPayableOrder().

Expected
Clean. With module-level novelty (S5), (payments, production, src/orders/repository.ts, findOrder, value) is in both E_BASE and E_END, so it is neither new nor repaired. loadPayableOrder is a function declaration, not a re-export, so there is no LAUNDERED finding.

Asserted fields are in expected.json; the matcher contract is in ../README.md.
